      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُمَرُّ</span></b>  A rope, (S, Msb,) and thread, (Msb,)
<i>tightly twisted:</i> (S, Msb:) a rope <i>well twisted:</i>
(TA:) and anything <i>twisted.</i> (M, TA.) See
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَرِيرٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  [Hence,] (tropical:)  A man, and a horse,
<i>strongly,</i> or <i>firmly, made.</i> (A, * TA.)

